1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,314
Five things to do in Madagascar.
The last one is unforgettable.

2
00:00:05,534 --> 00:00:08,676
Do go between April and October,
the dry season.

3
00:00:08,696 --> 00:00:11,030
Cyclones hit from January to March.

4
00:00:12,550 --> 00:00:16,739
Do take malaria prevention seriously.
Malaria is a risk all year.

5
00:00:18,259 --> 00:00:20,874
Do see the Avenue
of the Baobabs at sunset.

6
00:00:20,894 --> 00:00:23,259
The giant trees turn into silhouettes.

7
00:00:24,779 --> 00:00:30,134
Do see the Tsingy, a forest of stone.
Its pinnacles rise up to 60 meters.

8
00:00:31,654 --> 00:00:35,637
Do hear the indri sing at Andasibe.
It is the largest lemur,

9
00:00:35,657 --> 00:00:38,079
and its song carries two kilometers.
